#: data/de.capypara.FieldMonitor.metainfo.xml.in.in:49
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Field Monitor is a remote-desktop client designed for the GNOME platform."
msgstr ""
"Field Monitor je odjemalec za oddaljeni dostop do namizja, zasnovan za "
"platformo GNOME."

#. Translators: Part of the description of the application in the metainfo.
#: data/de.capypara.FieldMonitor.metainfo.xml.in.in:53
msgid ""
"It is focused on connecting to virtual machines, but can connect to any "
"server supporting the RDP, SPICE or VNC protocols."
msgstr ""
"Namenjen je povezovanju z virtualnimi računalniki, vendar se lahko poveže s "
"poljubnim strežnikom, ki podpira protokole RDP, SPICE ali VNC."

#. Translators: Part of the description of the application in the metainfo.
#: data/de.capypara.FieldMonitor.metainfo.xml.in.in:58
msgid ""
"It has support for directly connecting to VMs of the following hypervisors:"
msgstr ""
"Podpira neposredno povezovanje z virtualnimi računalniki naslednjih "
"hipervizorjev:"

#: data/de.capypara.FieldMonitor.metainfo.xml.in.in:62
msgid "Proxmox Virtual Environment"
msgstr "Navidezno okolje Proxmox"

#. Translators: Part of the description of the application in the metainfo.
#: data/de.capypara.FieldMonitor.metainfo.xml.in.in:64
msgid "QEMU/KVM via libvirt"
msgstr "QEMU/KVM prek libvirt"

#. Translators: Part of the description of the application in the metainfo.
#: data/de.capypara.FieldMonitor.metainfo.xml.in.in:67
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For supported VM hypervisors, Field Monitor also offers options to manage "
"the basic power state of VMs, such as starting, stopping, rebooting, etc."
msgstr ""
"Za podprte hipervizorje virtualnih računalnikov program Field Monitor ponuja "
"tudi možnosti za upravljanje osnovnih stanj napajanja virtualnih "
"računalnikov, kot so zagon, zaustavitev, ponovni zagon itn."

#. Translators: Part of the description of the application in the metainfo.
#: data/de.capypara.FieldMonitor.metainfo.xml.in.in:72
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Additionally, Field Monitor supports opening RDP and Virt-Viewer connection "
"files and quickly connecting to RDP, SPICE or VNC servers via URI."
msgstr ""
"Poleg tega program Field Monitor omogoča odpiranje datotek za povezavo RDP "
"in Virt-Viewer ter hitro povezovanje s strežniki RDP, SPICE ali VNC prek URI."

